{"persons":[{"fn":"Timm Johannes","sn":"G\u00F6ring","desc":"I am currently a high school student in the final years of my studies and I aspire to become an IT professional in the near future. My long-term vision is to use my technical knowledge not only to build innovative systems but also to create positive change in society. I am someone who enjoys structure but is also open to new challenges, and I am constantly looking for opportunities to grow \u2014 whether academically, personally, or socially.","bd":"2006-02-08T00:00:00.000Z","nn":["DevTimmOfTO"],"addr":"Vorderstra\u00DFe 11 99768 Harztor","prof":"Stundent","hob":"In my free time, I enjoy programming and experimenting with different technologies. I often spend hours building projects, whether it\u2019s a game, a website, or a new tool that solves everyday problems. Beyond coding, I also enjoy playing simulation games where I can design systems and manage resources, which matches my love for order and structure. Another hobby of mine is watching streams and content creators who inspire me, both for entertainment and for learning new perspectives. I also like organizing my environment, keeping things tidy, and even creating structured filing systems \u2014 something that gives me calmness and joy.","imgFile":"Timm_Johannes_G_ring_2025-09-03_23-13-35.bmp","religion":"Christianity - Protestantism","maritalStatus":"Single","volunteer":"I actively contribute to OpenStreetMap, a global community-driven project that helps improve maps and digital navigation for people all around the world. Mapping allows me to combine my interest in geography with my passion for technology. I also like to engage in online programming communities, where I help answer questions, share resources, and collaborate with others who are learning or working on coding projects. Volunteering in these digital spaces has taught me the value of teamwork and giving back to communities that rely on shared knowledge.","funFact":"I genuinely enjoy printing and organizing documents in folders \u2014 it might sound unusual, but for me it\u2019s both a creative outlet and a way to feel in control. \n\nI\u2019m a fan of detective and comedy series like Monk and Brooklyn Nine-Nine, which keep me entertained while also giving me a love for quirky characters and clever problem-solving. \n\nI really enjoy animated movies such as Turning Red, Inside Out, and Ratatouille. They\u2019re not just fun to watch \u2014 they also remind me of themes like independence, creativity, and emotional growth.\n\n Even though I\u2019m quite focused on tech, I also care deeply about social issues and fairness, which is why I sometimes imagine a future for myself in politics.","address":["Vorderstra\u00DFe 11","99768","Harztor","Thuringia","Germany"],"mov":[{"title":"Turning Red","year":"2022","overview":"Thirteen-year-old Mei is experiencing the awkwardness of being a teenager wit...","posterPath":"\/qsdjk9oAKSQMWs0Vt5Pyfh6O4GZ.jpg"},{"title":"Elemental","year":"2023","overview":"In a city where fire, water, land and air residents live together, a fiery yo...","posterPath":"\/4Y1WNkd88JXmGfhtWR7dmDAo1T2.jpg"},{"title":"Inside Out","year":"2015","overview":"When 11-year-old Riley moves to a new city, her Emotions team up to help her ...","posterPath":"\/2H1TmgdfNtsKlU9jKdeNyYL5y8T.jpg"},{"title":"Ratatouille","year":"2007","overview":"Remy, a resident of Paris, appreciates good food and has quite a sophisticate...","posterPath":"\/t3vaWRPSf6WjDSamIkKDs1iQWna.jpg"},{"title":"Brave","year":"2012","overview":"In the mystical Scottish Highlands, Merida is the princess of a kingdom ruled...","posterPath":"\/1XAuDtMWpL0sYSFK0R6EZate2Ux.jpg"},{"title":"Toy Story","year":"1995","overview":"Led by Woody, Andy's toys live happily in his room until Andy's birthday brin...","posterPath":"\/uXDfjJbdP4ijW5hWSBrPrlKpxab.jpg"}],"ser":[{"title":"The Nanny","year":"1993","overview":"Fran, fresh out of her job as a bridal consultant in her boyfriend\u2019s shop, fi...","posterPath":"\/4syShXMjaPAP3mG81ekhruv94sd.jpg"},{"title":"Brooklyn Nine-Nine","year":"2013","overview":"A single-camera ensemble comedy following the lives of an eclectic group of d...","posterPath":"\/hgRMSOt7a1b8qyQR68vUixJPang.jpg"},{"title":"Extra 3","year":"2004","overview":"Extra 3 is a political satirical magazine from Norddeutscher Rundfunk (NDR).","posterPath":"\/xuJffmaJ4sbJDsK4rXInAU1huSo.jpg"},{"title":"Die Anstalt","year":"2014","overview":"Claus von Wagner and Max Uthoff take a satirical look at social and political...","posterPath":"\/y902TTzjqgWZje5EtT3UIkB4NVW.jpg"},{"title":"Monk","year":"2002","overview":"Adrian Monk was once a rising star with the San Francisco Police Department, ...","posterPath":"\/3axGMbUecXXOPSeG47v2i9wK5y5.jpg"},{"title":"Psych","year":"2006","overview":"Thanks to his police officer father's efforts, Shawn Spencer spent his childh...","posterPath":"\/fDI15gTVbtW5Sbv5QenqecRxWKJ.jpg"}]}],"version":"1.2","created":"03.09.2025 23:13:35","application":"friendship book"}